      en: ["The company was founded in 1968 in the city of La Vega.", "Induveca is the market leader for meat products in the Dominican Republic.", "The factory possesses the most modern processing plant in the Caribbean.", "Salami Super Especial is their most famous and best-selling product.", "The company currently belongs to the MercaSID group.", "The factory complies with international ISO and HACCP certifications."],
